{"closureRow":1160,"acceptedOrdinal":2149,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457261883401","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Courier_Entrance_3_1_2_04ef6da","nodeNames":["Courier_Entrance_3_1_2"],"source":"Courier: Знаешь что, бери уже свой заказ, и я пойду отсюда.","sourceSha256":"5918e63aa04cfa23cee45c33753ff64a86e3a1c6fb68aa2cbd422cc08fb856dd","target":"Courier: Alam mo, kunin mo na ang order mo at aalis na ako rito.","components":["glossaryReferent"]}
{"closureRow":1161,"acceptedOrdinal":2151,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457261883399","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Courier_Entrance_3_1_2_00def62","nodeNames":["Courier_Entrance_3_1_2"],"source":"Courier: Ну ебать, спасибо, нахуй, за совет. Теперь-то мне сильно лучше стало.","sourceSha256":"69a7da8dd4155b4cfc8c037c45d7b8dad828681a7ca6399babd8651d0b6cda3e","target":"Courier: Putangina, salamat talaga sa payo mo. Ang laking ginhawa ko na ngayon, lintik.","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":1162,"acceptedOrdinal":2153,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457261883397","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Courier_Entrance_3_1_1_01ddff3","nodeNames":["Courier_Entrance_3_1_1"],"source":"(Взять заказ)","sourceSha256":"5fd9a90d5d8448b99677475cd3bffa6286b15df28d2cb1d4a926c1cb830ac9fd","target":"(Kunin ang order)","components":["glossaryReferent"]}
{"closureRow":1163,"acceptedOrdinal":2154,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457261883396","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Courier_Entrance_3_1_1_0d83a4a","nodeNames":["Courier_Entrance_3_1_1"],"source":"Courier: Ладно, мне надо ехать дальше. Бери свой заказ, и я поехал.","sourceSha256":"ea3efcbfa0d1ca96a7577f03ac5c6db7789fa48951fd6b65567eb127cb0f6cc8","target":"Courier: Sige, kailangan ko nang bumiyahe ulit. Kunin mo na ang order mo at aalis na ako.","components":["glossaryReferent"]}
{"closureRow":1164,"acceptedOrdinal":2156,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457261883394","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Courier_Entrance_3_1_1_0d6ead5","nodeNames":["Courier_Entrance_3_1_1"],"source":"Courier: Пусть ещё лобковые волосы объявят новым признаком, чтобы мир совсем ёбнулся…","sourceSha256":"dc9a4dbaff537fcfdcf3f3cf5ff91b01946492e51dd96d99605ac18e81ad0196","target":"Courier: Ideklara na rin sana nilang bagong palatandaan ang buhok sa ari para tuluyan nang mabaliw ang mundo…","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":1165,"acceptedOrdinal":2158,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457261883392","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Courier_Entrance_3_1_1_09a0c1d","nodeNames":["Courier_Entrance_3_1_1"],"source":"Courier: Все эти Гости, признаки и долбаное Солнце…","sourceSha256":"28691378a37c47acc9a60cf0ca69143da7e66524775eef243d9e2f03b1031c2a","target":"Courier: Lahat ng Mga Panauhing ito, ang mga palatandaan, at ang putanginang Araw…","components":["glossaryReferent","mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":1166,"acceptedOrdinal":2163,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457257689093","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Courier_Entrance_2_2_007eb91","nodeNames":["Courier_Entrance_2_2"],"source":"Courier: Вот ваш заказ: {0}.","sourceSha256":"48cd0ddab1ab8b8ae889d6719ae35be94089488d9f781576c6e3ad737a4e8a71","target":"Courier: Heto ang order ninyo: {0}.","components":["glossaryReferent","mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":1167,"acceptedOrdinal":2164,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457257689092","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Courier_Entrance_2_1_X_066bea4","nodeNames":["Courier_Entrance_2_1_X"],"source":"(Взять заказ)","sourceSha256":"5fd9a90d5d8448b99677475cd3bffa6286b15df28d2cb1d4a926c1cb830ac9fd","target":"(Kunin ang order)","components":["glossaryReferent"]}
{"closureRow":1168,"acceptedOrdinal":2165,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457257689091","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Courier_Entrance_2_1_X_08ffebc","nodeNames":["Courier_Entrance_2_1_X"],"source":"Courier: Ладно, ты вроде как заказ должен забрать. Возьмёшь его?","sourceSha256":"5f0a60d90561012a554eea577893c3bb8c6b753a9f5f236704aed92393fb5365","target":"Courier: Sige, kukunin mo yata ang order mo. Kukunin mo ba?","components":["glossaryReferent","mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":1169,"acceptedOrdinal":2167,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457257689089","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Courier_Entrance_2_1_2_06e832e","nodeNames":["Courier_Entrance_2_1_2"],"source":"Courier: К тому же, какая учёба, если всё равно меня никуда не возьмут.","sourceSha256":"23ccae0b41bbe7819bbaba2fafca1cfd9fb8d4930f22eac09172fcf307bd5fdb","target":"Courier: At saka, para saan pa ang pag-aaral kung hindi rin naman ako tatanggapin kahit saan?","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":1170,"acceptedOrdinal":2170,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457253494794","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Courier_Entrance_2_1_1_0f1ac1a","nodeNames":["Courier_Entrance_2_1_1"],"source":"Courier: Ага, конечно. У тебя-то куча народа дома, тебе легко говорить.","sourceSha256":"11e4ad5dd57196393264ab84cf805007193e1922aeb3d0a4a9b988d7b4503fd8","target":"Courier: Oo nga naman. Ang dami mong tao sa bahay, kaya madali para sa iyong sabihin iyan.","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":1171,"acceptedOrdinal":2176,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457253494788","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Courier_Entrance_1_2_0ac208d","nodeNames":["Courier_Entrance_1_2"],"source":"Courier: Вот ваш заказ: {0}.","sourceSha256":"48cd0ddab1ab8b8ae889d6719ae35be94089488d9f781576c6e3ad737a4e8a71","target":"Courier: Heto ang order ninyo: {0}.","components":["glossaryReferent","mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":1172,"acceptedOrdinal":2177,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457253494787","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Courier_Entrance_1_1_0798b2d","nodeNames":["Courier_Entrance_1_1"],"source":"(Взять заказ)","sourceSha256":"5fd9a90d5d8448b99677475cd3bffa6286b15df28d2cb1d4a926c1cb830ac9fd","target":"(Kunin ang order)","components":["glossaryReferent"]}
{"closureRow":1173,"acceptedOrdinal":2178,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457253494786","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Courier_Entrance_1_1_0373988","nodeNames":["Courier_Entrance_1_1"],"source":"Courier: Ладно, извините, я что-то отвлёкся. Вы возьмёте заказ?","sourceSha256":"87adc9ac9276b2be8c1da0de935f55e4d0524c40eee690c0816cffcd981c9ae8","target":"Courier: Sige, pasensiya na, nalihis ang usapan ko. Kukunin ninyo ba ang order?","components":["glossaryReferent"]}
{"closureRow":1174,"acceptedOrdinal":2179,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457253494785","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Courier_Entrance_1_1_0d36544","nodeNames":["Courier_Entrance_1_1"],"source":"Courier: И теперь люди заказывают по 20 литров воды. Эх, если бы надбавку или хоть чаевые оставляли за такой тяжёлый груз…","sourceSha256":"08f6205c38fc0be71eb65b8bf59130083fc4cc11f3508361715cde65a662f21e","target":"Courier: At ngayon, nag-oorder na ang mga tao ng tig-20 litrong tubig. Hay, sana man lang may dagdag na bayad o kahit tip sa pagbubuhat ng ganoon kabigat…","components":["glossaryReferent","mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":1175,"acceptedOrdinal":2181,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457249300491","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Courier_Entrance_1_1_02814ce","nodeNames":["Courier_Entrance_1_1"],"source":"Courier: К тому же за доставки сейчас очень хорошо платят. Риск-то большой, как ни крути.","sourceSha256":"70197305479004624b178291646846d0120c91ed87ceb67226954486ff54b53e","target":"Courier: At saka, malaki ang bayad sa paghahatid ngayon. Malaki rin naman ang panganib, kahit paano mo tingnan.","components":["glossaryReferent"]}
{"closureRow":1176,"acceptedOrdinal":2183,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457249300489","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Courier_Entrance_1_1_04952cb","nodeNames":["Courier_Entrance_1_1"],"source":"Courier: А я не ожидал, что люди не запаслись продуктами на конец света.","sourceSha256":"560b1a46078c659ed906ce87162e49c8785e505380c5c48e594c59eedf2d8762","target":"Courier: Hindi ko rin inasahang walang naipong pagkain ang mga tao para sa katapusan ng mundo.","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":1177,"acceptedOrdinal":2184,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457249300488","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:GraveDigger_Entrance_Bribe_0f82e3b","nodeNames":["GraveDigger_Entrance_Bribe"],"source":"Взяток не беру","sourceSha256":"16b893d9ceb611fba502afbec4a18eed5b6b127a9f8dcd4f5d82d332cc1e9e29","target":"Hindi ako tumatanggap ng suhol","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
