{"closureRow":1180,"acceptedOrdinal":2188,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457249300484","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:GraveDigger_Entrance_Bribe_0fc6cd0","nodeNames":["GraveDigger_Entrance_Bribe"],"source":"GraveDigger: Да ёлы-палы, мужик! Давай подкуплю тебя чем-нибудь?","sourceSha256":"23beb76353a93b19cef1044500358d8482bc715167ec61f9a22ef1a14e9f2f03","target":"GraveDigger: Naku naman, pare! Puwede ba kitang suhulan ng kahit ano?","components":["glossaryReferent","mandatoryRegression"]}
